{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02909","headline":"日暮望泾水 · 徐珩","name":"日暮望泾水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"导源径陇阪，属汭贯嬴都。\n下濑波常急，回圻溜亦纡。\n毒流秦卒毙，泥粪汉田腴。\n独有迷津客，怀归轸暮途。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐珩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}